# Production Durable Storage (Neon / Supabase / Managed PostgreSQL):
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@ep-cold-shadow-123456.us-east-2.aws.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require

# CORS Allowed Origins (Comma-separated list of deployed domains):
